<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφρόνη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔφρων</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the kindly time</i>, euphem. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span>, <i>night</i>, chiefly poet., <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				560
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i>, etc.: also in 
				Ion.
			 and late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				56
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.85b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστρων εὐ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστερόεσσα εὐ</span>
			., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφρόνης,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτός</span>
			, <i>by night</i>, Epist.<i><span class="en">
				Anaximen.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ εὐφρόνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					221
				</span></i>
			 (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				259
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφροσύνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1470
			</span></i> codd. (lyr., sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφροσύναν</span>).</div>
